      "heading": "Electronics:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Electronics:\nFocusing on the design and functioning of electronic devices and circuits, including analog and digital systems, semiconductors, transistors, microprocessors, and microcontrollers.",
