      "heading": "Communication Systems:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Communication Systems:\nEmphasizing the principles of data transmission and communication networks, with topics such as wireless communication, satellite systems, fiber optics, and network protocols.",
      "token_count": 30
    },
    {
