      "heading": "Signal Processing:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Signal Processing:\nTeaching students to analyze and interpret various types of signals (e.g., audio, video, digital data) for applications like image processing, audio enhancement, and speech recognition.\nThe ECE department aims to prepare students for careers in rapidly evolving technology fields, from telecommunications and broadcasting to embedded systems and IoT (Internet of Things).\nFaculty",
